# These files are deployed as they are onto Linux, and claw/ onto a busybox
# board that refuses CRLF outright. core.autocrlf=true is set on kil's PC, so
# without these rules a fresh clone converts them and the deployment fails in a
# way that says nothing useful (/bin/sh^M: bad interpreter).
*.sh       text eol=lf
*.conf     text eol=lf
*.service  text eol=lf
vodloopctl text eol=lf
